# Amiga 1991 (Chahi). Reference fixture is the *retro-presskit* dump
# (AnotherWorld_Disk{A,B}_nologo_noprotec.adf, package md5
# 5dca377e0e1506d5cf83317b1495f3e8), NOT the archive.org dump this comment
# used to name.
#
# Established by A/B regeneration on 2026-09-12 (#0112): rebuilding the
# reference tree from the archive.org dump changes resource 0x15 and makes
# amiga CODE_WHEEL mismatch (28/29), while the press-kit reproduces 29/29 and
# matches the bytecode.rom md5 recorded in AWVM_Tools' amiga.toml
# (dbeeae497600f5ba5d51fdbf4e71ad1f). The registry, this source tree and
# tools/regen_disasm.py all agree on the press-kit; only this comment did not.
#
# CODEWHEEL_CHECK below is therefore describing the press-kit build. Note that
# chahi_amiga_1991/CODE_WHEEL.asm has no `.if CODEWHEEL_CHECK` arm yet, so the
# flag does not gate anything for that stage; adding the archive.org dump as a
# second verify target needs that arm first.

BYTECODE_BRANCH=chahi_amiga_1991
CODEWHEEL_CHECK=on
BEETLE_KICK_GATE_1=on
BEETLE_RENDERING_GATE_2=off
INCLUDE_UNREACHABLE_CODE=on
